y entering a marketing contest for her new game, but intentionally excludes Masuzu. She also explains why she thinks the relationship is fake. As everyone prepares for the trip to the beach, Eita realizes that Ai, Hime and Chiwa have become good friends while leaving Masuzu alone. Both Masuzu and Eita are also rattled by Saeko-san.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mm1jc3UsykJaHjDVlLoUAYzWRNi.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 11","synopsis":"Saeko offers the girls a chance to save money on the trip by entering a marketing contest for her new game, but intentionally excludes Masuzu. She also explains why she thinks the relationship is fake. As everyone prepares for the trip to the beach, Eita realizes that Ai, Hime and Chiwa have become good friends while leaving Masuzu alone. Both Masuzu and Eita are also rattled by Saeko-san.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mm1jc3UsykJaHjDVlLoUAYzWRNi.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9305","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"14749","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"14749","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"53296","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"264052","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"12265","synopsis":"The club went to a trip to the beach. All of them had a quality time as a club. Chiwa, Ai, and Hime decided to have a key chain or a cellphone strap as a uniform or thing that symbolizes their club. This action made Masuzu realize that they are not like her. She also told Eita that she would not win the contest and thanks him for everything and she also told Eita that she would set him free after the contest. In the end of the episode, Eita got ran over accidentally by Mana. They have a short conversati